#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/lua.xml:113
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Lua"
msgstr "Instalação do \"Lua\""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/lua.xml:116
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Some packages check for the <application>pkg-config</application> file for "
"<application>Lua</application>, which is created with:"
msgstr ""
"Alguns pacotes verificam o arquivo <application>pkg-config</application> "
"para <application>Lua</application>, o qual é criado com:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/lua.xml:120
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; lua.pc &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>V=5.4\n"
"R=&lua-version;\n"
"\n"
"prefix=/usr\n"
"INSTALL_BIN=${prefix}/bin\n"
"INSTALL_INC=${prefix}/include\n"
"INSTALL_LIB=${prefix}/lib\n"
"INSTALL_MAN=${prefix}/share/man/man1\n"
"INSTALL_LMOD=${prefix}/share/lua/${V}\n"
"INSTALL_CMOD=${prefix}/lib/lua/${V}\n"
"exec_prefix=${prefix}\n"
"libdir=${exec_prefix}/lib\n"
"includedir=${prefix}/include\n"
"\n"
"Name: Lua\n"
"Description: An Extensible Extension Language\n"
"Version: ${R}\n"
"Requires:\n"
"Libs: -L${libdir} -llua -lm -ldl\n"
"Cflags: -I${includedir}</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; lua.pc &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>V=5.4\n"
"R=&lua-version;\n"
"\n"
"prefix=/usr\n"
"INSTALL_BIN=${prefix}/bin\n"
"INSTALL_INC=${prefix}/include\n"
"INSTALL_LIB=${prefix}/lib\n"
"INSTALL_MAN=${prefix}/share/man/man1\n"
"INSTALL_LMOD=${prefix}/share/lua/${V}\n"
"INSTALL_CMOD=${prefix}/lib/lua/${V}\n"
"exec_prefix=${prefix}\n"
"libdir=${exec_prefix}/lib\n"
"includedir=${prefix}/include\n"
"\n"
"Name: Lua\n"
"Description: Uma Linguagem de Extensão Extensível\n"
"Version: ${R}\n"
"Requires:\n"
"Libs: -L${libdir} -llua -lm -ldl\n"
"Cflags: -I${includedir}</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/lua.xml:144
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Lua</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>Lua</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/lua.xml:148
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../lua-&lua-version;-shared_library-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"make linux</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../lua-&lua-version;-shared_library-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"make linux</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/lua.xml:156
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>make test</command>.  <quote>This will "
"run the interpreter and print its version</quote>.  More comprehensive tests"
" can be performed if you downloaded the \"Test suite\" tarball. Those tests "
"need to be executed after the package is installed, thus we defer to the "
"description below."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make test</command>. <quote>Isso "
"executará o interpretador e imprimirá a versão dele</quote>. Testes mais "
"abrangentes podem ser realizados se você baixou o \"tarball\" da \"Suíte de "
"teste\". Esses testes precisam ser executados depois que o pacote estiver "
"instalado, por isso seguimos para a descrição abaixo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/lua.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/lua.xml:167
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make INSTALL_TOP=/usr                \\\n"
"     INSTALL_DATA=\"cp -d\"            \\\n"
"     INSTALL_MAN=/usr/share/man/man1 \\\n"
"     TO_LIB=\"liblua.so liblua.so.5.4 liblua.so.&lua-version;\" \\\n"
"     install &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir -pv                      /usr/share/doc/lua-&lua-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -v doc/*.{html,css,gif,png} /usr/share/doc/lua-&lua-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m644 -D lua.pc /usr/lib/pkgconfig/lua.pc</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make INSTALL_TOP=/usr               \\\n"
"     INSTALL_DATA=\"cp -d\"            \\\n"
"     INSTALL_MAN=/usr/share/man/man1 \\\n"
"     TO_LIB=\"liblua.so liblua.so.5.4 liblua.so.&lua-version;\" \\\n"
"     install &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir -pv                      /usr/share/doc/lua-&lua-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -v doc/*.{html,css,gif,png} /usr/share/doc/lua-&lua-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install -v -m644 -D lua.pc /usr/lib/pkgconfig/lua.pc</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/lua.xml:179
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Here we describe only the \"Basic tests\". Untar the tarball and change to "
"the <filename class=\"directory\">lua-&lua-version;-tests</filename> "
"directory, then issue <command>lua -e \"_U=true\" all.lua</command>. If the "
"tests finish without error, you will see a message containing the string "
"\"final OK\"."
msgstr ""
"Aqui descrevemos somente os \"Testes básicos\". Descompacte o \"tarball\" e "
"mude para o diretório <filename class=\"directory\">lua-&lua-"
"version;-tests</filename> e emita <command>lua -e \"_U=true\" "
"all.lua</command>. Se os testes terminarem sem erros, [então] você verá uma "
"mensagem contendo a sequência de caracteres \"final OK\"."

